==German==

===Etymology===
Variation of {{m|de|derb}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|de|adjective}}

# {{lb|de|colloquial|chiefly|northern Germany}} {{alternative form of|de|derb|t=cool|lit=rough}}
#: {{syn|de|krass}}
#: {{ux|de|Der Typ is’ echt '''derbe'''.| That guy’s really '''cool'''.|lit=That guy’s really '''rough'''.}}
#: {{uxi|de|'''derbe''' Beats}}

===Adverb===
